2) Student loan interest ($4,400)
- The student loan interest deduction is an above‑the‑line deduction (up to $2,500) but phases out for single/HOH filers with MAGI from $75,000 to $90,000 in 2023.  
- Your preliminary gross income (84,900 W‑2 + 12,500 contracting + ~1,930 interest) is about $99k, above the $90k phaseout end — so you likely cannot take the student‑loan interest deduction for 2023.  
