7) Qualified Business Income (QBI) deduction
- You may be eligible for a 20% QBI deduction on qualified business income from your Schedule C. For 2023, the simple Form 8995 is used for many filers. Because your taxable income likely stays under the higher thresholds, QBI could apply. It’s computed on Form 8995 (or 8995‑A). I can estimate this if you want.

